WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.429
Welcome to LEDGER-Q. Drug Q is a saved

00:04.429 --> 00:08.509
synthetic quality case. Evidence and AI assurance connect

00:08.509 --> 00:12.589
here. This is not commercial investigation.

00:15.349 --> 00:19.878
Sign-in opens an empty workspace. Working proof stays

00:19.878 --> 00:24.405
separate. Inspect the original or confirm a private

00:24.405 --> 00:28.933
copy. Existing evidence stays untouched.

00:30.350 --> 00:34.301
Read the SOP and original assay. Ninety-four point

00:34.301 --> 00:38.254
two conflicts with ninety-nine point one percent. Keep

00:38.254 --> 00:42.206
the original evidence attached.

00:45.350 --> 00:49.718
Conflicting evidence creates HOLD. Root cause is unknown.

00:49.718 --> 00:54.085
Batch disposition is undecided. A summary cannot replace

00:54.085 --> 00:58.454
missing investigation proof.

01:00.350 --> 01:04.694
CAPA needs evidence of cause, implementation and effectiveness.

01:04.694 --> 01:09.037
Nothing is invented. Missing proof blocks closure. Preserve

01:09.037 --> 01:13.382
the original result.

01:15.349 --> 01:19.501
Sources connect quality events, CAPA, training and AI

01:19.501 --> 01:23.653
use. Changes reopen affected work. AI cannot independently

01:23.653 --> 01:27.805
decide cause or release.

01:30.349 --> 01:34.309
AI saves planner, specialist and reviewer attempts. Document

01:34.309 --> 01:38.269
permission is required. Model responses cannot sign or

01:38.269 --> 01:42.229
approve the record.

01:45.349 --> 01:49.605
Inspect history and the evidence packet. Old decisions

01:49.605 --> 01:53.861
cannot approve changed evidence. Open the case below.

01:53.861 --> 01:58.117
Professional benefits remain unproven.
